[0.053, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.614, "o", "\r\n  DEMO  youliangtan/so101-table-cleanup\r\n        a community SO-101 recording, 80 episodes over four instructions, metadata only, bundled with this package (Apache-2.0).\r\n        Run `orbit cover` in a folder with your own dataset to see yours.\r\n"]
[0.021, "o", "\r\n  COVERAGE  so101_table_cleanup  (80 episodes, 4 instructions, v2.1)\r\n  read from meta/episodes.jsonl and meta/episodes_stats.jsonl\r\n\r\n  INSTRUCTIONS\r\n    template     Grab {A} and place into pen holder\r\n    A            pens 20, markers 20, tapes 20, scissor 20\r\n\r\n  EPISODES\r\n    length       3 to 1073 frames, median 614; 15 under half the median\r\n                 (index 23, 24, 63, 64, 67, 69, ...)\r\n    idle joints  all 6 joints moved under 5% of their range in 2 of 80\r\n                 episodes (index 23, 24)\r\n\r\n  WHERE THE ARM SAT   mean joint position per episode, by thirds of its recorded range\r\n                          lower middle  upper\r\n    shoulder_pan.pos          1     76      3\r\n    shoulder_lift.pos         2     77      1\r\n    elbow_flex.pos            1     56     23\r\n    wrist_flex.pos            0     17     63\r\n    wrist_roll.pos            0     72      8\r\n    gripper.pos              52     28      0\r\n    empty cells  32 of 72 task x joint x third combinations hold no episode\r\n\r\n  THE"]
[0.000, "o", " LARGEST GAP\r\n    in 'Grab markers and place into pen holder', elbow_flex.pos never\r\n    averaged in the lower third of its recorded range; the other two thirds\r\n    hold 13 and 7 episodes.\r\n\r\n  This counts what was recorded. It does not say a gap caused a failure, and\r\n  it never scores a demonstration.\r\n\r\n"]
[4.022, "x", "0"]
